# ---------- Secrets / environment ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
# appsettings.json chứa connection string, JWT key, API key thật.
# Sao chép appsettings.example.json -> appsettings.json rồi điền giá trị.
appsettings.json
!appsettings.example.json
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem

